{"team":"HOU","col":"#F2405A","identity":"balanced","funnel":"balanced-D","plays_pg":63.0,"adot":8.3,"report_html":"<div class=\"report\"><h2>A Balanced Attack</h2><p>HOU throw by design. They pass <strong>-0%</strong> over expectation (league -2%) and keep firing even with a lead (43% early-down pass when ahead vs ~41%) \u2014 the kind of pass-first identity that keeps receivers live in every script.</p><h3>The Offensive Blueprint</h3><p>When they fall behind they abandon the run entirely \u2014 60% pass while trailing, so their pass-catchers have huge comeback-script ceilings.</p><p>They're a heavy under-center team (60% shotgun vs ~68%) \u2014 a pro-style, run-committed structure.</p><p>By the numbers it's a struggling unit \u2014 a 40% success rate (below the 44% average).</p><h3>In the Red Zone</h3><p>Inside the 20 they lean run-heavy, passing <strong>52%</strong> of the time, funnelling touchdown equity to <strong>Woody Marks</strong>.</p><h2>Defense \u2014 A Balanced Defense</h2><p>They lock down opposing WR2s \u2014 just 30 rec yds/game (vs ~36); fade receiving props there.</p><p>They lock down opposing tight ends \u2014 just 28 rec yds/game (vs ~35); fade receiving props there.</p><p>They surrender <strong>100 rushing</strong> and <strong>210 passing</strong> yards per game (league ~120 / ~230). No dominant funnel \u2014 read it matchup by matchup.</p><p>They give up deep shots (22% of throws travel 15+ vs ~19%) \u2014 big-play WR upside against them.</p><p>A stingy, efficient defense \u2014 just 38% success allowed (vs ~44%); temper expectations for opposing skill players.</p><p>They leak <strong>TE touchdowns</strong> (0.34/game vs ~0.24) \u2014 an anytime-TD spot to attack.</p><h2>The Betting Angles</h2><p>Bottom line: their pass-catchers have massive ceilings in comeback scripts (fade-material as underdogs); <strong>opposing TE anytime-TD</strong> is a repeatable angle.</p><p><em>Built on 2024\u201325 data; the profile rebuilds through the season as the current staff and roster set their own tendencies.</em></p></div>","depth":{"QB":[{"name":"C.J. Stroud","slot":"QB1","starter":true,"td":8,"props":{"Comp":20.12,"Att":31.57,"Pass Yds":236.91,"Pass TD":1.34,"INT":0.53,"Rush Yds":13.48}}],"RB":[{"name":"David Montgomery","slot":"RB1","starter":true,"td":24,"props":{"Rush Att":4.36,"Rush Yds":18.56,"Tgt":2.02,"Rec":1.46,"Rec Yds":11.62}},{"name":"Woody Marks","slot":"RB2","starter":true,"td":25,"props":{"Rush Att":12.46,"Rush Yds":45.39,"Tgt":2.83,"Rec":2.05,"Rec Yds":16.71}},{"name":"Jawhar Jordan","slot":"RB3","starter":false,"td":16,"props":{"Rush Att":7.85,"Rush Yds":34.88,"Tgt":2.36,"Rec":1.95,"Rec Yds":13.18}},{"name":"British Brooks","slot":"RB4","starter":false,"td":14,"props":{"Rush Att":3.23,"Rush Yds":14.04,"Tgt":1.34,"Rec":0.91,"Rec Yds":6.87}}],"WR":[{"name":"Nico Collins","slot":"WR1","starter":true,"td":24,"props":{"Tgt":5.89,"Rec":3.79,"Rec Yds":56.07,"Rec TD":0.27}},{"name":"Xavier Hutchinson","slot":"WR2","starter":true,"td":13,"props":{"Tgt":4.97,"Rec":2.84,"Rec Yds":32.44,"Rec TD":0.14}},{"name":"Jaylin Noel","slot":"WR3","starter":true,"td":9,"props":{"Tgt":2.05,"Rec":1.17,"Rec Yds":13.41,"Rec TD":0.1}},{"name":"Kayshon Boutte","slot":"WR4","starter":false,"td":27,"props":{"Tgt":5.23,"Rec":3.32,"Rec Yds":48.48,"Rec TD":0.32}},{"name":"Lewis Bond","slot":"WR5","starter":false,"td":13,"props":{"Tgt":2.91,"Rec":1.58,"Rec Yds":19.65,"Rec TD":0.14}}],"TE":[{"name":"Dalton Schultz","slot":"TE1","starter":true,"td":17,"props":{"Tgt":3.97,"Rec":2.85,"Rec Yds":30.05,"Rec TD":0.19}},{"name":"Foster Moreau","slot":"TE2","starter":false,"td":11,"props":{"Tgt":2.19,"Rec":1.32,"Rec Yds":14.85,"Rec TD":0.12}},{"name":"Cade Stover","slot":"TE3","starter":false,"td":10,"props":{"Tgt":2.91,"Rec":1.82,"Rec Yds":15.27,"Rec TD":0.11}}]},"schedule":[{"week":1,"ha":"vs","opp":"BUF","opp_col":"#4C8DFF","gid":"2026_01_BUF_HOU","spread":"+1.5","proj":"22\u201324","win":false},{"week":2,"ha":"vs","opp":"CIN","opp_col":"#FB4